      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sterling_City%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Santa Fe Railroad arrived in 1910, turning Sterling City into a rail stop before the service was later discontinued.",
